2026-07-27T11:35:03.2248780Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T11:35:03.2249031Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T11:35:03.2249405Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T11:35:03.2250201Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T11:35:03.2250729Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
